"Costumes dress this device in generic shapes; its own addresses stay its own. Nothing here copies a real device's identity, clones an advertisement the ear has heard, or plants a fake tracker — a wardrobe, not a forgery kit." = "Os disfarces vestem este dispositivo com formas genéricas; os seus próprios endereços continuam seus. Nada aqui copia um dispositivo real.";
